# Payment screenshots contain personal information (names, e-wallet numbers,
# reference numbers), so they must never be fetched straight from the browser.
#
# Customers never see this folder, and administrators read a screenshot through
# api/admin-payment-proof.php, which checks for a valid admin session first.
#
# If your Apache ignores .htaccess files, move this folder outside the web root
# and update $uploadDir in api/payment-submit.php accordingly.

Options -Indexes
Require all denied
